          "title": "You'll want to know: شکار",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شکار (shekâr) — \"hunting; prey, game\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شکار (shekâr) در این منطقه ممنوع است. Shekâr dar in mantaqe mamnu' ast. Hunting is forbidden in this area."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A hunter is a shekârchi."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "shekâr is a native word, which EtymDB lists with the senses 'hunting, game'; it is usually traced to Middle Persian škār."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
