              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ماهیگیری (mâhigiri) — \"fishing\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پدرم جمعه ها به ماهیگیری میرود. Pedaram jom'e-hâ be mâhigiri miravad. My father goes fishing on Fridays."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "mâhi 'fish' + gir 'catching' + -i."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "mâhigiri is a native compound of mâhi 'fish', from Middle Persian māhīg (EtymDB), and gir, the present stem of gereftan 'to take', with the ending -i."
            }
          ]
        },
